---
title: Reservation State Machine
---
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Tentative : planner selects a warehouse-batch-quantity slice (no stock held yet)
    Tentative --> Reserved : conditional update succeeds (Version matches, Available >= quantity)
    Tentative --> Released : SO rolled back (shortage or version conflict)
    Reserved --> Issued : stock physically issued at dispatch (OnHand decreases)
    Reserved --> Released : quote rejected, quote/payment expired or SO withdrawn
    Issued --> [*]
    Released --> [*]
